                "message": "CHANGELOG: nightly tidy for 2026-11-04\n\nRebuild the Being developed list after the union merge brought back stale\ncopies of lines already tidied (Tangle check, Vault performance, Emacs\nhangs at start). Move the litnote/author-note PRs (#280 to #282) into\ntheir feature set and the Stow Magit PRs (#272, #275) into the Magit set,\nmerge the keymap lines (#278, #283, #284), add #285, and start the root\nCHANGELOG.org for non-Emacs changes (#271, #274).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG",
